sequenceDiagram
  participant HTTP as API /rag/ingest
  participant PREP as PreparedAsyncIngestionExecutionService
  participant PUB as JobCoreRuntimeIngestionPublisher.publish
  participant LEDGER as job_core.job_runs (PostgreSQL)
  participant WP as Worker pai (JobCoreWorkerPollingRuntime)
  participant FAN as DocumentFanoutCoordinator
  participant WC as Worker filho (mesmo poller)
  participant PDF as Pipeline PDF
  participant IDX as Indexacao final

  HTTP->>PREP: valida request e compoe YAML
  PREP->>PUB: publish(dispatch_mode=prepared_yaml)
  PUB->>LEDGER: cria job pai em queued
  WP->>LEDGER: claim_next_run (FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED)
  LEDGER-->>WP: entrega job pai reivindicado
  WP->>FAN: build_plan() quando fan-out e elegivel
  FAN->>PUB: submete filhos (dispatch_mode=document_fanout_child, max_active_children)
  PUB->>LEDGER: cria filhos em queued
  WC->>LEDGER: claim_next_run (respeita max_active_children do pai)
  LEDGER-->>WC: entrega documento filho reivindicado
  WC->>PDF: executa slice PDF do documento
  PDF->>IDX: devolve chunks para indexacao
  IDX-->>WC: persistencia e telemetria terminal
  WC->>LEDGER: complete_run (estado terminal)
